       golden noble cat and the sum of a fair sweet golden cat and a fair cat.
Romeo: Speak your mind.
Romeo: Speak your mind.
Romeo: Let us proceed to Scene VII.

                    Scene VI: The Other Curse.

Romeo: You are the sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy pretty cat and a
       fair cat.
Romeo: Speak your mind.
Romeo: You are the sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy pretty cat and the
       sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy cat and the sum of a fair sweet
       golden noble cat and the sum of a fair sweet cat and a cat.
Romeo: Speak your mind.
Romeo: You are the sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy pretty cat and the
       sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy cat and the sum of a fair sweet
       golden noble cat and the sum of a fair sweet golden cat and a fair cat.
Romeo: Speak your mind.
Romeo: Speak your mind.

                    Scene VII: The Turning Of The Page.

Romeo: You are the sum of a fair sweet golden cat and a fair cat.
Romeo: Speak your mind.

Juliet: Are you worse than the sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy pretty
        cat and the sum of a fair sweet golden noble happy cat and a fair
        sweet cat?
Juliet: If so, let us return to Scene II.

[Exeunt]
